WEBVTT

00:13:28.804 --> 00:13:30.973
working conditions

00:13:31.014 --> 00:13:32.391
and distribution of profits.

00:13:32.432 --> 00:13:34.101
This is not a pipe dream.

00:13:34.518 --> 00:13:39.648
Mondragon in Spain
has over 80,000 employee owners,

00:13:39.690 --> 00:13:43.652
takes in over 13 billion dollars a year

00:13:43.694 --> 00:13:49.032
and redistributes its profits
to build worker skills and capacities

00:13:49.032 --> 00:13:51.326
among its member cooperatives.

00:13:51.952 --> 00:13:55.706
A newer approach is to use
platform technologies

00:13:55.747 --> 00:13:58.625
to teach workers their rights.